# Both eyrya.com and www.eyrya.com serve the full site today (both answer 200).
# Every page's canonical points at www, so Google should consolidate them, but
# serving the same content on two hostnames splits any inbound links and doubles
# the crawl surface. Send the apex to the canonical host.
#
# If this rule does not take effect on Cloudflare Pages (host-based redirects in
# _redirects are not reliably supported), use a dashboard Redirect Rule instead:
#   Workers & Pages -> your project -> Custom domains, or
#   the zone's Rules -> Redirect Rules:
#     when hostname equals eyrya.com  ->  redirect to https://www.eyrya.com/$1, 301
https://eyrya.com/*  https://www.eyrya.com/:splat  301
